\subsection{Data Collection}
\label{appendix:gonerd_data_collection}

Data for GONERD was obtained through Giant Oak's GONER software, which scraped web articles from public facing online news sources as well as the U.S. Department of Justice's \textit{justice.gov} domain. This webtext data was randomly sampled with an upweighted probability toward documents from \textit{justice.gov} so that \textit{justice.gov} consisted of roughly 25\% of the total GONERD dataset. A combination of automatic and manual filtering was then applied to remove text containing code and other unwanted data, such as sequences deemed to be short, noisy, or near-duplicates. 

